{
    "title": "Build Your First Game",
    "description": "Do you aspire to become a game developer? Do you keep exploring what technologies power the fun mobile games?\r\n\r\nWith the <b>Learn Game development</b> app, you can gain knowledge about game development programming languages and coding frameworks. On this app, you can find courses and tutorials to help you excel in game programming. You can not only learn about the theoretical concepts on game development and programming, but also experience hands on game coding using this app.\r\n\r\nThe app includes step by step bite size interactive lessons to help you learn game development. All the course on the app is curated by experts in the field of software engineering. \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Course Content</b>\r\nThis app includes courses to help you learn Game Development. We shall learn the most powerful open source frameworks to develop mobile games for Mobile devices. \r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Introduction to C#\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Types of Data\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 C# Operations\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Strings, Input, Output\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Develop 2D and 3D Games\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Game Objects\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Scripting\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Asset Store\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 User Interface (UI)\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Adding audio to game\r\n\r\nApart from learning these course, you can also try our in-app compiler to run live coding and to practice coding. You will also have access to several sample programs to help you learn quicker and better.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhy Choose this app?\r\nThere are numerous reasons why this Game Development Tutorial app is the best choice to help you learn Game Development.\r\n\ud83e\udd16 Fun bite-sized course content\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Audio Annotations (Text-to-Speech)\r\n\ud83d\udcda Store your course progress\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Course Content created by Google Experts\r\n\ud83c\udf93 Get Certification in Game Development Course\r\n\ud83d\udcab Backed by the most popular \"Programming Hub\" app\r\n\r\nWhether you're preparing for a software examination or preparing for a job interview in game development, this is the only tutorial app you'll ever need to prepare yourself for the interview questions or examination questions. You can practice coding and programming examples on this fun programming learning app.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Share some Love</b> \u2764\ufe0f\r\nIf you like our app, please share some love by rating us on the play store.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>We Love Feedback</b>\r\nHave any feedback to share? Feel free to send us an email on hello@programminghub.io\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>About Programming Hub</b>\r\n<i>Programming Hub is a premium learning app that is backed by Google's Experts. Programming Hub offers research backed combination of Kolb's learning technique + insights from experts which ensures you learn thoroughly. For more details, visit us on <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fprogramminghub.io&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0DolvC-0LbhZGiS-ZNeSfM\">www.prghub.com</a></i>",
